  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIC CONTRACT SP01-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to ensure that children at risk of being left behind in rural/urban settings in Tanzania will have access to quality early childhood education (ECE). It will have a particular focus on girls. The objective is to ensure that these children will access at least one year of quality ECE and be ready for primary education. It anticipates that evidence of improved outcomes can be used for advocacy by civil society and with Government to support further scale up and longevity of impact.</narrative>
  </description>
